really be skipped, so the full suite was run instead of argued about, and it passes -
69 passed in 380.52 s, see `20260930T233800Z_suite69_full.out` in this directory. The
argument in this file is kept because "when is a carry-over legitimate" is worth having on
record; it is no longer the only evidence for the slow 20.
